<title>AUSTRALIA: ANZ to issue A$200 mln bond - sources.</title>
<headline>ANZ to issue A$200 mln bond - sources.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The ANZ Banking Group is close to launching a A$200 million fixed rate transferable deposit issue, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bonds are expected to mature in July 2000 and come at a spread of 25 basis points over government bonds, the sources said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
